---
layout: "layout"
title: "International Academy of Sfax | Lead Education Group"
background_color: "light-blue"
bottom_div_color: "white"
---

<main role="main">

  <section class="lead-main" aria-label="Lead Eduction Group Hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="lead-main-inner">
          <div class="lead-main-text">
            <h1>Our Approach</h1>
            <p>LEAD Education Group believes that education is a primary means to future success for individuals, societies and for entire nations.</p>
            <p>Through the vehicle of international schools, students are given opportunity to become successful and influential leaders who will promote systemic and positive change in their societies and nations.</p>
          </div>
          <%= image_tag '0.jpg', class: 'lead-main-image', alt: 'International Academy of Sfax' %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  <section aria-label="first" class="banner-section second">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-after-header--inner">
        <%= image_tag '0.jpg', class: 'section-central-image mb-5' %>
        <div class="section-header wider">
          <h2>Developing future leaders</h2>

          <div class="values-list">
            <div class="list-section">
              <div>
                <i class="far fa-check-circle fa-2x"></i>
                <h5>Multilingual Education</h5>
                <p>Having a multilingual education is vital, that is why we teach in English, French, and Arabic, utilising native speakers.</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <i class="far fa-check-circle fa-2x"></i>
                <h5>Learning Methods</h5>
                <p>We utilize a variety of teaching and learning methods, like Common Core.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="list-section">
              <div>
                <i class="far fa-check-circle fa-2x"></i>
                <h5>Integrated Technology</h5>
                <p>We incorporate advanced technology to enhance learning.</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <i class="far fa-check-circle fa-2x"></i>
                <h5>Develop Life Skills</h5>
                <p>We help students develop analyzing and problem-solving skills.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-label="third" class="banner-section svg-borders-top-white bg-background-color">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 banner-d-flex">
          <%= image_tag 'iasfax-outside.jpg', class: 'section-image' %>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 banner-d-flex">
          <div class="inner-text">
            <p class="top-accent-text">Accredation</p>
            <h3>Toward an education recognized globally</h3>
            <p>The International Academy of Sfax will seek accreditation through the Middle States Association (MSA) of Universities and Schools. The accreditation process takes several years to complete. IAS will operate under their guiding principles and will follow their directions.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </section>

  <section aria-label="third" class="banner-section svg-green-borders-section bg-light-green">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 banner-d-flex">
          <div class="inner-text">
            <p class="top-accent-text">Lead Education Group</p>
